  "sourceFacts": {
    "horizontalBasis": "Exact-QID main and narrow cross skylight; long western spine edge fixes axis. Eight shell panels and independent belfry courtyard estimated from four inspected photos.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Retained exact-QID OSM way120704384/Q1193480 matches current main35184492793216. Its full45-vertex low-envelope plan and current12-vertex cross skylight part35184492793214 remain rigidly rotated, without rescaling; absent height/min_height on main and absent min_height on part remain absent. The part40m tag describes the narrow roof cross envelope, not a solid whole church. Retained39.4m fact controls main high eastern shell tip; center27.5m, western30m, north32m, south26.5m, low annex6m, panel valley feet and internal subdivisions are picture estimates. Eight ruled curved sails approximate the exterior, not engineering-exact hyperbolic paraboloids. Bell tower position[-13,16]m,3.2x2.6m footprint,61.6m auxiliary height, unequal blades/bells and8x8m courtyard pocket are picture/context estimates with5m position/5degree orientation uncertainty, not PMTiles controls or surveyed data. Tower height is separate from39.4m main shell fact. Derived Boolean inputs round0.1mm; raw plans stay exact."
  },
